@page "/"

<PageTitle>Burmese Poker — the table</PageTitle>

<h1>Watch the table</h1>

<p class="lede">
    Four computer players, one round after another, at a pace you can follow. Every hand is
    concealed until somebody lays down all thirteen — including from you, watching, which is
    the strictest case there is: there is no hand here that anybody may legitimately be shown.
</p>

@*
    ⚠️ The render mode is named here and nowhere else. The page around it is static SSR, which
    is the default and the thing that cannot be walked back cheaply (§3.11 C12).
*@
<TableView @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
